{"id":"fec296dc8eb84564","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-use-preservation.md","title":"有限使用的保持引理","display":"lem-use-preservation — 有限使用的保持引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-use-preservation","aliases":["20-lem-use-preservation"],"display":"lem-use-preservation — 有限使用的保持引理","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.3.9 与式 (3.10)；同历史给相同 use","source_pdf_pages":[93],"source_printed_pages":[57],"depends_on":["[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-use-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-use-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-use-preservation — 有限使用的保持引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.3.9 与式 (3.10)；同历史给相同 use"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(x)\\downarrow=y\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\upharpoonright u_e^A(x)=B\\upharpoonright u_e^A(x)\">\\(A\\upharpoonright u_e^A(x)=B\\upharpoonright u_e^A(x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}use\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y,\\qquad u_e^B(x)=u_e^A(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}use\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y,\\qquad u_e^B(x)=u_e^A(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对有限计算长度归纳：普通步相同，每个查询都落在相同前缀内，故查询答案相同。两次计算的全部配置与查询数相同。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.3.9 与式 (3.10) 的有限使用性质；印刷页 57；PDF 第 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"